EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE SELECT COUNT(*) FROM t1 JOIN t2 ON t1.grp = t2.grp;
EXPLAIN
-> Vectorized aggregate: count(0)
    -> Inner hash join (t1.grp = t2.grp)
        -> Vectorized table scan on t1 in secondary engine Rapid
        -> Hash
            -> Vectorized table scan on t2 in secondary engine Rapid

