EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE SELECT t1.grp, COUNT(*), SUM(t1.val) FROM t1 JOIN t2 ON t1.grp = t2.grp GROUP BY t1.grp ORDER BY t1.grp;
EXPLAIN
-> Group vectorized aggregate: count(0), sum(t1.val)
    -> Nested loop inner join
        -> Sort: t2.grp
            -> Vectorized table scan on t2 in secondary engine Rapid
        -> Filter: (t1.grp = t2.grp)
            -> Vectorized table scan on t1 in secondary engine Rapid

